Audio Duration: 5m 10.9s (310.86s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 14:59:26 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 澳门有个朋友作弊的
Segment #2   [00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,640] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 7  | Text: 去年赚了一个多亿
Segment #3   [00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,040] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后前两时间一起吃饭了
Segment #4   [00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:04,940] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 他问我说小豆
Segment #5   [00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,160] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 10 | Text: 你知道我最喜欢你哪篇作品吗
Segment #6   [00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,220] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 我说哪一篇
Segment #7   [00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,160] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 他说就是那篇
Segment #8   [00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,100] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 沉默成本
Segment #9   [00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,640] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是成本那篇
Segment #10  [00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:11,920] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 1  | Text: 好吧
Segment #11  [00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,240] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 7  | Text: 今天专门在一个视频
Segment #12  [00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,580] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 14 | Text: 专门的去讲一下经济学里的这句话
Segment #13  [00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,660] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是沉默成本
Segment #14  [00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,700] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是成本
Segment #15  [00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,880] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 我先来看看大家
Segment #16  [00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,860] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 9  | Text: 有没有一个做生意的头脑
Segment #17  [00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,320] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 9  | Text: 适不适合做一个生意人
Segment #18  [00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,020] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 9  | Text: 有一个很简单的小测试
Segment #19  [00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:24,920] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 我来说一下
Segment #20  [00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,680] | Elapsed:  14.65s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是有一个人到集市上去买牛
Segment #21  [00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:30,440] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 花500块钱去买了一桶牛
Segment #22  [00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:33,540] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 11 | Text: 然后转手600块钱卖给了别人
Segment #23  [00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:34,580] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 卖完之后
Segment #24  [00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,160] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 他感觉他妈好像卖便宜了
Segment #25  [00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:36,860] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 卖亏了
Segment #26  [00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,920] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 又找到那个人
Segment #27  [00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,680] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 9  | Text: 花了700块钱买了回来
Segment #28  [00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,780] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后等到下午
Segment #29  [00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,420] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个集市快要结束的时候
Segment #30  [00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,580] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 7  | Text: 800块钱又卖了出去
Segment #31  [00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,180] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后在这个过程中
Segment #32  [00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,980] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个人是赚了还是赔了
Segment #33  [00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,280] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果说是赚赚了多少
Segment #34  [00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,620] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 是赔是赔了多少
Segment #35  [00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,720] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个时候你可以很简单的想
Segment #36  [00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,680] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是他500卖的
Segment #37  [00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,820] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 600卖的
Segment #38  [00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,760] | Elapsed:  30.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 觉得卖亏了之后
Segment #39  [00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,120] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 700卖回来
Segment #40  [00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,060] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 800又卖出去
Segment #41  [00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,880] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看到这个地方的时候
Segment #42  [00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,700] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 你点下暂停
Segment #43  [00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,740] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 你拿笔算一下
Segment #44  [00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,100] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后算完之后
Segment #45  [00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:05,820] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 你重新再看这个视频
Segment #46  [00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,980] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 重新再看这个视频
Segment #47  [00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,800] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 8  | Text: OK 你的结果出来了吗
Segment #48  [00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,100] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 我来告诉你
Segment #49  [00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:12,440] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 他赚了200块
Segment #50  [00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:13,500] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 2  | Text: 为什么呢
Segment #51  [00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,000] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是因为你可以把它看多成
Segment #52  [00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,440] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 两次独立的买卖行为
Segment #53  [00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,540] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 500卖的
Segment #54  [00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:18,460] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 600卖的
Segment #55  [00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:18,820] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 2  | Text: 赚100
Segment #56  [00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,060] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 600卖回去
Segment #57  [00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,520] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后这不是700块钱买回来吗
Segment #58  [00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,500] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 700卖的
Segment #59  [00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:24,440] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 800卖的
Segment #60  [00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:25,000] | Elapsed:  46.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 又赚100
Segment #61  [00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,920] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 这就是两次独立的买卖行为
Segment #62  [00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,300] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人都会算错
Segment #63  [00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:30,440] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 主要错在哪个环节
Segment #64  [00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,340] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是感觉
Segment #65  [00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:32,940] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 妈自己花700块钱再买回来
Segment #66  [00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:34,140] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 就感觉亏了
Segment #67  [00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,980] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 其实很多人是没有这种
Segment #68  [00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,160] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 做生意的头脑的
Segment #69  [00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,660] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 其实最简单的办法
Segment #70  [00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,060] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 你把第二投牛
Segment #71  [00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:42,020] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 看做成另外一投牛
Segment #72  [00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,660] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说一只养一匹马
Segment #73  [00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:45,340] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 你就可以很简单的理解了
Segment #74  [00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:48,520] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 这就是两个独立的买卖行为
Segment #75  [00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,520] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 买了卖赚100
Segment #76  [00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,040] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 买了又卖又赚100
Segment #77  [00:01:51,540 --> 00:01:52,680] | Elapsed:  62.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人都会出错
Segment #78  [00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,400] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人都会感觉
Segment #79  [00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,020] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 700块钱再买回来
Segment #80  [00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:56,180] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就感觉亏了
Segment #81  [00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,500] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 你为什么不想一些
Segment #82  [00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:59,100] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 想一想它的其他价值
Segment #83  [00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,960] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是因为你没有考虑到
Segment #84  [00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:01,960] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 沉默成本
Segment #85  [00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:03,620] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 什么是沉默成本
Segment #86  [00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:06,300] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是它已经沉默在水里的成本
Segment #87  [00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:07,800] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 已经不再是成本了
Segment #88  [00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,820] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 就比方说
Segment #89  [00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:09,320] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 举个例子
Segment #90  [00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,660] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们开了一个饭店
Segment #91  [00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,080] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后我们前期
Segment #92  [00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,320] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 做了详细的市场调研
Segment #93  [00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,580] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 觉得我们适合干
Segment #94  [00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:15,980] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后开始装修
Segment #95  [00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:17,720] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 购买大量的设备招人
Segment #96  [00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:19,200] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 到最后发现人流量
Segment #97  [00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,280] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 达不到自己的预期
Segment #98  [00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,080] | Elapsed:  80.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个饭店是麻亏钱的
Segment #99  [00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,820] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 最正确的做法是什么
Segment #100 [00:02:23,820 --> 00:02:24,520] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 是直损
Segment #101 [00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,420] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 关了饭店
Segment #102 [00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:27,360] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是有很多人就总会想
Segment #103 [00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,800] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 13 | Text: 我从饭店里投入了太多的成本
Segment #104 [00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,040] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 大量的人力 物力 财力
Segment #105 [00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,940] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 11 | Text: 我是不是要再等一段时间看一看
Segment #106 [00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,240] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 结果就是什么
Segment #107 [00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,140] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 结果就是越等越亏
Segment #108 [00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:38,660] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 2  | Text: 越亏
Segment #109 [00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:39,780] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 它越不知道直损
Segment #110 [00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,880] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 11 | Text: 还有一些在感情上也是一样的
Segment #111 [00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:44,120] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 假设上有一个女孩
Segment #112 [00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:47,000] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 她找了一个男朋友
Segment #113 [00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,940] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后真正开始交往之后
Segment #114 [00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:51,080] | Elapsed:  95.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 发现她的男朋友有暴力
Segment #115 [00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,260] | Elapsed: 112.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 喜欢喝酒
Segment #116 [00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:53,460] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 还没事还总去奥美
Segment #117 [00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:54,700] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 没事给她两个高遍腿
Segment #118 [00:02:55,180 --> 00:02:57,180] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 12 | Text: 就这种情况最正确的行为是什么
Segment #119 [00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:58,780] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是快速的直损
Segment #120 [00:02:58,780 --> 00:02:59,400] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 摧掉她
Segment #121 [00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,760] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是很多人都会想
Segment #122 [00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,540] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 我跟这个男孩子在一起
Segment #123 [00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:03,560] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 已经很多年了
Segment #124 [00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,100] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 甚至已经见过父母了
Segment #125 [00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:06,680] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 我跟他同居都这么久了
Segment #126 [00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,420] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的青春
Segment #127 [00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:09,620] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 11 | Text: 他妈从他那耗费一大半了
Segment #128 [00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:12,340] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 14 | Text: 于是继续的在这个错误的男人身上
Segment #129 [00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:13,280] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 耗下去
Segment #130 [00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,200] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 耗得越多
Segment #131 [00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,380] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就越不舍得直损
Segment #132 [00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,780] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是因为你从里边投入的成本
Segment #133 [00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,200] | Elapsed: 112.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 太多了
Segment #134 [00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,660] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以做正确的选择
Segment #135 [00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,680] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 做正确的决定
Segment #136 [00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,800] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 就一定要忽略着要沉默成本
Segment #137 [00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:28,760] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 已经沉下去的成本
Segment #138 [00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:31,060] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 已经不能再为你真正后期
Segment #139 [00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:32,600] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 产生输赢的行为
Segment #140 [00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,200] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 你在做预判的时候
Segment #141 [00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,400] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 就不要考虑这些成本
Segment #142 [00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,000] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为它已经不是成本了
Segment #143 [00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,120] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 就像股票也是一样
Segment #144 [00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,120] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 11 | Text: 很多人眼睁睁的看了一个股票
Segment #145 [00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,140] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 一路起飞
Segment #146 [00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:43,400] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 自己当时在10块钱的时候
Segment #147 [00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,160] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有买入
Segment #148 [00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,900] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后现在它变成20了
Segment #149 [00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,360] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 2  | Text: 30了
Segment #150 [00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:46,820] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 2  | Text: 40了
Segment #151 [00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:47,380] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 2  | Text: 50了
Segment #152 [00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,120] | Elapsed: 129.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 眼睁睁的看了它
Segment #153 [00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,760] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 同样买房子也是一样
Segment #154 [00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,920] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 当年广州深圳的房子
Segment #155 [00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,720] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 8000块钱
Segment #156 [00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,720] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 多少人没上车
Segment #157 [00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,440] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 等到15000的时候
Segment #158 [00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,380] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 它老是后悔8000的时候没上车
Segment #159 [00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:02,460] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后到最后眼睁睁的看了
Segment #160 [00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:03,860] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个房子变成3万
Segment #161 [00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:04,360] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 5万
Segment #162 [00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:04,740] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 8万
Segment #163 [00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:05,180] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 6万
Segment #164 [00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:07,420] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 你可以简单的理解为
Segment #165 [00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:09,720] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 13 | Text: 这个房子已经不是原来的这套房子了
Segment #166 [00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,900] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 是另外一桶牛
Segment #167 [00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,920] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 另外一只养
Segment #168 [00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:12,780] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 另外一瓶马
Segment #169 [00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:15,000] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 14 | Text: 同样这个股票也不是原来那只股票了
Segment #170 [00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,240] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 你就可以很轻松的说服自己了
Segment #171 [00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,660] | Elapsed: 145.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是沉默成本
Segment #172 [00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:20,360] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 7  | Text: 已经不正式成本了
Segment #173 [00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:21,980] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 我不知道你们听懂没有
Segment #174 [00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:24,100] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个视频之前可能拍过好多次
Segment #175 [00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,860] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 9  | Text: 可能因为我配字幕不合适
Segment #176 [00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:26,680] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 还不知道怎么原因
Segment #177 [00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,940] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 6  | Text: 被下架过几次
Segment #178 [00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:29,100] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 6  | Text: 今天再重新拍一次
Segment #179 [00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:31,080] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们可以算一算
Segment #180 [00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:31,960] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 在评论区里
Segment #181 [00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,140] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 3  | Text: 算一算
Segment #182 [00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:34,900] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 7  | Text: 刚才我给你说的那个
Segment #183 [00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:36,720] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 6  | Text: 举的那个小测试
Segment #184 [00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,720] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 9  | Text: 看看你们是不是合作一个生意人
Segment #185 [00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:40,820] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个视频再拍一遍
Segment #186 [00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:42,280] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 8  | Text: 以后有很多人没看过
Segment #187 [00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,260] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 有的时候我也不知道
Segment #188 [00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:44,800] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 8  | Text: 这些人算账怎么算的
Segment #189 [00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,840] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 有时候捉换100
Segment #190 [00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:46,980] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 还有时候赔钱
Segment #191 [00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,420] | Elapsed: 162.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是你不要抬高
Segment #192 [00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:50,120] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 11 | Text: 你不要跟我说他付出的时间经历
Segment #193 [00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,480] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 2  | Text: 怎么办
Segment #194 [00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,760] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 11 | Text: 我只是做一个简单的一个小测试
Segment #195 [00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,020] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 只是举个例子
Segment #196 [00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,280] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不要说在一个下午
Segment #197 [00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,100] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 挣200月来的时候
Segment #198 [00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:56,660] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 我还不如上
Segment #199 [00:04:56,660 --> 00:04:58,120] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 进场打螺丝
Segment #200 [00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,640] | Elapsed: 176.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 老铁门视频不要抬高
